                "comment_count": 0,
                "committer": {
                    "date": "2025-03-06T10:31:52Z",
                    "email": "iphydf@users.noreply.github.com",
                    "name": "iphydf"
                },
                "message": "fix(Startup): Allow Tox Address in the friend address settings.\n\nWe parse it as Tox public key, but allow nospam+checksum suffixes.\n\nAlso, don't crash when the Tox public key is the wrong size. It'll\nprobably do weird things afterwards, but there seem to be real users\nwith those broken (0-sized) keys in their settings. I'd rather not load\nthem, but the NDEBUG behaviour was to accept them, so we keep them like\nthis for now.\n\nFixes #562. Fixes #567.",
                "tree": {
                    "sha": "ea7764e143545b14a97614a26c8e3b0791dc0d34",
                    "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/TokTok/qTox/git/trees/ea7764e143545b14a97614a26c8e3b0791dc0d34"
                },
                "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/TokTok/qTox/git/commits/cab4cee05d82a75379fc3764ef5a4656fde13307",
                "verification": {
                    "payload": "tree ea7764e143545b14a97614a26c8e3b0791dc0d34\nparent 2ce5a135c650056631c96152e28bb95864a65bcb\nauthor iphydf <iphydf@users.noreply.github.com> 1740571166 +0000\ncommitter iphydf <iphydf@users.noreply.github.com> 1741257112 +0000\n\nfix(Startup): Allow Tox Address in the friend address settings.\n\nWe parse it as Tox public key, but allow nospam+checksum suffixes.\n\nAlso, don't crash when the Tox public key is the wrong size. It'll\nprobably do weird things afterwards, but there seem to be real users\nwith those broken (0-sized) keys in their settings. I'd rather not load\nthem, but the NDEBUG behaviour was to accept them, so we keep them like\nthis for now.\n\nFixes #562. Fixes #567.\n",
